  "english": {
    "HOK_KOR_expand_gangwon_coal_mines": "Expand the Gangwon Coal Mines",
    "HOK_KOR_expand_gangwon_coal_mines_desc": "Even where we have found coal seams, miners' pickaxes alone cannot raise output without the equipment to bring the coal to the surface. We will widen the workings and improve drainage, ventilation and haulage to increase output across the Gangwon coalfield.",
