    "HOK_KOR_expand_pohang_steelworks_desc": "Founding the Pohang Iron and Steel Company gave us a foundation for producing our own steel. To meet growing industrial demand, we must expand the blast furnaces, steelmaking and rolling facilities, and improve the docks and transport links that bring in raw materials. Expanding the works will give our factories and shipyards a reliable supply of steel."
